/**
 * One control plane for every workflow, shown all at once: the four domains
 * as lanes, each running its own flow at the same time. On the left of a
 * lane, Melissa's copy for the domain and its way on; on the right, its
 * executed topology in the product's node design, on a glow of the domain's
 * colour.
 */
